# Local run artifacts. DVC manages its own per-file .gitignore entries
# automatically when `dvc add` runs (e.g. a data/processed/.gitignore that
# excludes only the raw file dvc add was pointed at) -- don't duplicate
# that here with a broader directory-level rule. An earlier version of
# this file had `*/data/processed/` and `*/data/chunks/` (trailing slash =
# whole directory ignored), which also caught the .dvc pointer files that
# live in those same directories, since anything inside an ignored
# directory is ignored too. That silently broke every `dvc add`/`dvc push`
# targeting them: `dvc add` couldn't create a trackable .dvc file at all
# ("bad DVC file name ... is git-ignored"), and the failure didn't stop
# notebook execution, so it looked like nothing was wrong until a later
# notebook tried to `dvc pull` a pointer file that was never created.
mlflow.db
mlruns/
*/outputs/synthetic_qa/*.parquet
*/outputs/reports/*.csv

.env
*.egg-info/
